            <description sparkle:format="markdown"># Recap generation improvements

- More reliable generation of action items and meeting recaps.
- Clearer live progress throughout generation, including retries.
- Improved handling of longer discussions while retaining detailed topic summaries and decisions.

Refresh a meeting’s recap to use these improvements. Your saved transcripts remain available.
</description>
